:::text id=txt_hdr_s7 at=top-left width=80% height=80 offsetX=80 offsetY=56 preset=title align=left color=text fontSize=38
# Rules of Engagement — Pet Peeves & Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=card_peeves at=top-left width=530 height=480 offsetX=80 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_peeves at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=104 offsetY=184 name=slash size=32 color=#EF4444
:::

:::text id=txt_peeves at=top-left width=480 height=380 offsetX=104 offsetY=232 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=17
**Pet Peeves (What to Avoid):**

- **Unscheduled communication** for non-urgent matters that interrupt focus time.
- **Refusal of ideas** or proposals without clear reasons or context.
:::

:::shape id=card_rules at=top-left width=530 height=480 offsetX=670 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_rules at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=694 offsetY=184 name=check-circle size=32 color=#10B981
:::

:::text id=txt_rules at=top-left width=480 height=380 offsetX=694 offsetY=232 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=17
**Golden Rules (What Works Best):**

- **Notify me beforehand** for synchronous check-ins to respect calendar flow.
- **Give reasons** for idea/proposal refusal, and optionally suggest alternatives.
:::
